+ Features:

 Textboxes/dialogue pacing and sfx fix;
 Some fixes on the splash and the presentation for the game characters;
 Fixes on both broken audio loops and animations;
 You asked for it, and so we did it: a slight change on controller's button mapping, swapping between submit button and cancel button to better fit the player's leisure.


+ The game is now 34% off!
